+Use case: stylized-concept. Create a production sprite sheet for BOOMTOOTH by Crownforge. Output PNG exactly 1536×1024 with REAL transparent alpha background. Input reference D1.png is mandatory STYLE reference only: reproduce its hand-inked adult 2D comic/cartoon game symbols, thick slightly irregular black brush contours (4–7 px at 1024), thinner inner lines, crisp flat TWO-TONE cel shading and one off-white sharp highlight per volume. Simple readable shapes, hand-drawn materials, warm golden-orange afternoon light from upper left, blue-violet shadows. Palette burnt orange #E8742A, pine #2F5D46 / #1E3B2E, granite #6F7F92 / #46526A, TNT red #D7332B, gold #F2B233, honey wood #C98A45 / #6B4526, cream #F4E6C8, ink #1B1410.
+Layout: exactly TWO isolated elements, large main symbol LEFT (about 900 px tall, complete silhouette) and its separate animation component RIGHT, same physical drawing scale and matching perspective as it would have on main symbol. At least 100 px completely empty transparent gap between silhouettes. Keep all content inside 3–6% outer safety margin. No background, grid, cell, frame, ground, drop shadow, checkerboard, white backing, halo, annotations, signature or watermark. No photorealism, smooth 3D, airbrush, gradients, blur, neon, border effects. The detached component must fit its attachment on the main symbol by translation without resizing or rotating. Only specified text allowed.
+
+Strict production cutouts: zero glow or haze, no atmospheric lighting outside silhouettes. All empty pixels alpha 0. Crisp ink edges. Outer margins at least 50 px.LEFT: expressive brown glossy-furred otter surveyor bust, head and shoulders three-quarter looking at player, pencil behind ear, small BLUE construction helmet, pocketed work vest, satisfied mischievous smile, rolled plan tucked under arm. RIGHT: large UNROLLED blue blueprint sheet, slightly undulating, thin white line drawings of mountain and beaver face carved in it, absolutely no text or letters. Blueprint same physical scale as rolled paper when unrolled, detached and large.
+CORRECTION: enforce at least 120 pixels transparent gap between every part of bust and blueprint. Main bust in x=80..710 y=65..955; blueprint in x=900..1455 y=260..820. NO headlamp on helmet. Rolled plan tucked UNDER arm, not held across front by hand. Blueprint uses simple WHITE LINE ART only, not shaded scenic rendering. Absolutely no hazy halos or background glow, flat cutout asset.
